      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>On 19 June, the fourth and final day of the Republican National Convention in 1916, the invocation was offered by Rabbi Gerson B. Levi of Temple Israel (Chicago) at the Chicago Coliseum in Chicago, Illinois, as recorded in <tei:hi rend="italic">The Official Report of the Proceedings of the Republican National Convention 1916</tei:hi>, page 101.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
